{"4843960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BORE to the CORE", "steam_appid": 4843960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BORE to the CORE</strong> is a frantic co-op automation &amp; base defense game for up to 4 players<strong>, </strong>in which you constantly balance between surviving dangers, fixing problems and building up your base with physics based automation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on an epic journey to the core of the world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the Mole Rat Queen's orders, you are to venture to the core of the world and conquer that paradise for Her Majesty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843960/extras/585448adb1139f6b9258d92b0f50c64c.poster.avif?t=1784535024\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843960/extras/585448adb1139f6b9258d92b0f50c64c.webm?t=1784535024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843960/extras/585448adb1139f6b9258d92b0f50c64c.mp4?t=1784535024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare for lots of dangers though 12 biomes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The earth is a dangerous place. Venture through  the gaseous Vapor Veins, the hostile Noisy Nests, the barren Bedrock Belt, the steaming Molten Mantle, and many more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843960/extras/94d19261f1ac5da259f1cd2b364a4612.poster.avif?t=1784535024\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843960/extras/94d19261f1ac5da259f1cd2b364a4612.webm?t=1784535024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843960/extras/94d19261f1ac5da259f1cd2b364a4612.mp4?t=1784535024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and automate your moving base, produce weapons and defenses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The queen did not have enough budget to equip you with good tools or weapons. You'll have to make them yourself. Use physics based automation and tier up to make the tools and weapons that you need to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843960/extras/45f0b39e6150902c6294b9af70f60d2a.poster.avif?t=1784535024\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843960/extras/45f0b39e6150902c6294b9af70f60d2a.webm?t=1784535024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843960/extras/45f0b39e6150902c6294b9af70f60d2a.mp4?t=1784535024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's definitely too much to do all on your own. Fight together, build together, plan and fix your base, control the bore, scavenge the tunnel and distribute the tasks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you know? - In real life, naked mole rats actually do all the work for their Queen, and they have individual roles that they fulfill for their whole life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BORE to the CORE</strong> is a frantic co-op automation &amp; base defense game for up to 4 players<strong>, </strong>in which you constantly balance between surviving dangers, fixing problems and building up your base with physics based automation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on an epic journey to the core of the world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the Mole Rat Queen's orders, you are to venture to the core of the world and conquer that paradise for Her Majesty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843960/extras/585448adb1139f6b9258d92b0f50c64c.poster.avif?t=1784535024\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843960/extras/585448adb1139f6b9258d92b0f50c64c.webm?t=1784535024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843960/extras/585448adb1139f6b9258d92b0f50c64c.mp4?t=1784535024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare for lots of dangers though 12 biomes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The earth is a dangerous place. Venture through  the gaseous Vapor Veins, the hostile Noisy Nests, the barren Bedrock Belt, the steaming Molten Mantle, and many more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843960/extras/94d19261f1ac5da259f1cd2b364a4612.poster.avif?t=1784535024\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843960/extras/94d19261f1ac5da259f1cd2b364a4612.webm?t=1784535024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843960/extras/94d19261f1ac5da259f1cd2b364a4612.mp4?t=1784535024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and automate your moving base, produce weapons and defenses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The queen did not have enough budget to equip you with good tools or weapons. You'll have to make them yourself. Use physics based automation and tier up to make the tools and weapons that you need to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843960/extras/45f0b39e6150902c6294b9af70f60d2a.poster.avif?t=1784535024\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843960/extras/45f0b39e6150902c6294b9af70f60d2a.webm?t=1784535024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843960/extras/45f0b39e6150902c6294b9af70f60d2a.mp4?t=1784535024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's definitely too much to do all on your own. Fight together, build together, plan and fix your base, control the bore, scavenge the tunnel and distribute the tasks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you know? - In real life, naked mole rats actually do all the work for their Queen, and they have individual roles that they fulfill for their whole life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Your crew of naked mole rats pilots a huge tunnel bore on a rather insane trip to the core of the world. Automate your base, try not to die and reach the core with up to 4 players.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843960/1709f542d9b64a0b0f8a06d0597a052dafd02ae7/header.jpg?t=1784535024", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843960/8c29dd89b92910af54ea363d63896392698dcc3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784535024", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843960/8c29dd89b92910af54ea363d63896392698dcc3f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784535024", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3 or Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 950 or Radeon HD 7970<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 or Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Wikkl Works"], "publishers": ["Wikkl Works"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac":